<title>JAPAN: MOF to auction 6-mth T-bills on Thursday - traders.</title>
<headline>MOF to auction 6-mth T-bills on Thursday - traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance (MOF) is expected to offer six-month Treasury bills (T-bills) through a price-competitive auction on Thursday, traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>MOF's offers are likely to be worth 1.3 trillion yen, aiming to roll over 1.3 trillion yen of six-month T-bills maturing on June 10, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +813-3432-8570</p>
